      "sum": "Paris has six main-line stations (Gare du Nord, Gare de l'Est, Gare de Lyon, Montparnasse, Saint-Lazare, Austerlitz). High-speed TGV and Ouigo trains leave from them, and RER and Transilien trains cover the suburbs.",
